{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-zh","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回收站插件。它在会话标题栏加入垃圾桶按钮，在侧栏会话菜单加入删除入口，并在设置页提供归档会话管理。用户可以先归档会话并保留日志，之后还原，也可以永久删除会话日志、子代理会话和缓存；设置页还支持多选操作、清空回收站及清理较早的归档会话。它适合需要整理 DSH 会话并在误删时恢复的用户。使用前需要 DSH 数据目录；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1384-1424","index.js:451-599","index.js:612-703"]}
{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-en","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin adds archive management to the DSH web client. Header and sidebar actions archive sessions while keeping logs; Settings lets users browse, restore, or permanently delete them. Batch and age-based cleanup are supported. It needs the DSH data directory and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1384-1424","index.js:451-599","index.js:612-703"]}
