{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#feature-1","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 的功能「软删除会话」：会话头部按钮或侧栏菜单可将当前会话归档到回收站，保留磁盘日志并记录标题与归档时间；用户之后可在设置页找到它。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:576-638","index.js:451-512"]}
{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#feature-2","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 的功能「还原会话」：在回收站设置页选择一条或多条归档会话并执行还原；插件将其移出归档集合，日志文件保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1008-1025","index.js:515-537"]}
{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#feature-3","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 的功能「永久删除会话」：用户确认后可删除所选会话的日志目录、子代理会话数据和投影缓存，并清理工作区引用；单条、批量或清空回收站都可操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1054-1091","index.js:612-703"]}
{"unit_id":"Afgkwyp__dsh-session-recycle-bin#feature-4","repo":"Afgkwyp/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"c4aeee746616408b2adb1e65adfda1b61662fd03","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 的功能「按时间批量清理」：设置页可清理早于指定天数的归档会话；插件优先使用归档记录时间，缺失时参考日志修改时间，时间无法确定的条目会保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:557-583","client.js:1281-1334"]}
